  "flag": "The kill band is DERIVED BY FITTING a single clonogenic series in C6 rat glioma (two 1 h exposures; Caballero Navarro 1992, Histol Histopathol 7:347-351) with -log10(survival) = 0.0426 x exposure (half-kill near 7, one log of kill at 23.5 umol*h/L). Single study, one rat line, and not cleanly proportional at the top dose. It is a band, never a line.",
